# Feature description: Computes the residual between rank_relative_position_sum and rank_relative_sqrt_sum to capture outlier rank positions.
# Usefulness: This feature detects hands where rank positions deviate significantly from their standardized counterparts, aiding in identifying unique rank groupings.
