# sequential_depth_ratio
# Feature description: Computes the ratio of rank_relative_sqrt_sum to exponential_rank_sum, then applies a logarithmic transformation to emphasize sequential rank distributions with large magnitude differences.
# Usefulness: This feature accentuates hands with strong sequential characteristics and substantial rank distributions, which are useful in detecting straights or straight flushes.
